{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:15 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:15 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:15 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"俞可程打破被雪藏傳聞  神隱兩日火速復工拍《東張》外景  \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/c1b85f4dbdf03ee665f604e9e288d4ff/2026-11/cats_74.jpg\"/><p>「東張女神」俞可程（Kanis）參加《女神配對計劃2》人氣急升，近日卻被爆疑與TVB綜藝科高級導演鄭韜畧（Marcus）拍拖，單身人設被質疑。事件曝光後，她沒有出現於《萬千星輝賀台慶》的紅地毯外，據知有份演出的環節亦被抽起，一度惹來「被雪藏」疑雲，不過據知她昨日(21日)已復工為《東張西望》拍攝外景，工作似乎未受緋聞是非影響。</p><img alt=\"俞可程（Kanis）參加《女神配對計劃2》人氣急升。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/33706a1118760b2fe9d70ef416a5d0b3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_17_59_50_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"身為好友的何佩珈表示找對方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a791e18c77c44e0c34623a76084ca97c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_17_59_50_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"俞可程在節目中亦有分享自己的愛情觀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b41bbfbabf3f6d1d27db71c5d49729cd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_17_59_50_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"《女神配對計劃2》自播映以來，成為圈中熱話。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e08c885f3daecbf3c5aea841f24b683e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_17_59_50_4_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"為了節目，俞可程特別修身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/dc063c8cb365eacb8fed28cd32e28a72/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_17_59_50.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:24:01.471109+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:15:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T18:57:50.904007+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T11:17:25.099808+00:00","content_hash":"784c62f5891503ba638842d77bcc7e9ecc75f775760c1b169216af0c8f856e33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}